  "objective_summary": "Landed RefillProposal@1 / SemanticRefill@1 / BoundedRefillTriggerPolicy@1 as a pure planning leaf and wired BacklogRefinery to emit evidence-backed refill proposals under fail-closed bounds. Every LGSWF-080 required trigger (semantic, proof, assurance, merge, failure, provider, resource, granularity, progress, steering, external_change) builds a content-addressed proposal carrying evidence, impacts, validation, uncertainty, dedupe, fallback, and review. Idle capacity alone cannot generate work; cosmetic rewrites cannot bypass semantic dedupe; completion contracts cannot be weakened; claimed/running/settling/completed/accepted history is immutable. Proposals never authorize execution, mutation, completion, or acceptance. Worker completion or task status alone is insufficient.",
